Third-party software and models (not included in this repository)
-----------------------------------------------------------------
- The `voxlock` Python package (https://github.com/arbazsiddiqui/voxlock, Apache License 2.0) is installed from PyPI as a
  requirement; the nodes call its public API.
- Model files (arbazsiddiqui/voxlock on Hugging Face, Apache License 2.0) are not included and are never downloaded by the
  nodes; tools/download_model.py fetches them at the revision the voxlock 1.1.1 package uses, when you run it.

